# Plugin DLL Placeholder Directory
# 
# This directory contains plugin DLL files for Zabbix Agent 2 with Aggplugin.
# 
# Source: Custom measurement plugins
# Files: *.dll (Windows 64-bit)
# Typical size: 50-500 KB per DLL
#
# Installation instructions:
# 1. Build or obtain the measurement plugin DLLs
# 2. Place them in this directory: win\bin\plugins\
# 3. These files will be automatically excluded from git (see .gitignore)
#
# Plugin DLLs are loaded by aggplugin-agent2.exe based on the configuration:
# Plugins.Aggplugin.PluginPath=%%INSTALL_PATH%%\bin\plugins\*.dll
#
# Common plugin examples:
# - cpu_plugin.dll (CPU monitoring)
# - disk_plugin.dll (Disk I/O monitoring)
# - network_plugin.dll (Network monitoring)
# - custom measurement plugins as needed
